---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Dr. Sandeep • Astro Portfolio & AI Healthcare Platform" description="GitHub-ready showcase page for a professional Astro portfolio and AI healthcare intelligence platform.">
  <div class="showcase-content">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <article class="hero-panel">
          <div class="eyebrow">⚡ Professional GitHub repo • Astro • MDX • Rich HTML ingestion</div>
          <h2><span>Clinical intelligence</span> meets a polished portfolio engine.</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            This repository is structured as a serious publishing system for healthcare AI, medical knowledge,
            research pages, visual explainers, and operational dashboards. It is designed for fast static delivery,
            controlled content growth, and clean GitHub deployment.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#structure">View repo structure</a>
            <a class="btn secondary" href="#workflow">See workflow</a>
          </div>

          <div class="metrics" aria-label="Project highlights">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="num">40+</span>
              <div class="label">Static routes generated and validated</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="num">3</span>
              <div class="label">Core content tiers: MDX, Astro, RichContentShell</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="num">1</span>
              <div class="label">Deterministic ingestion pipeline</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="num">100%</span>
              <div class="label">Static-build friendly, GitHub-ready architecture</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <aside class="side-panel">
          <h3>What makes this repo strong</h3>
          <ul class="mini-list">
            <li>
              <strong>Clean information architecture</strong>
              Categories are grouped for clarity instead of being scattered across flat navigation.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Safe rich-content handling</strong>
              Complex HTML pages are wrapped in a defensive shell to avoid layout breakage.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Controlled publishing pipeline</strong>
              HTML ingestion is sanitized, categorized, and converted into Astro pages predictably.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>GitHub-friendly operations</strong>
              Source code lives in the repo, generated output is built locally, and deployment stays deterministic.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="overview">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Project overview</h3>
            <p>
              A premium Astro-based portfolio and knowledge platform for healthcare AI, medical research, operational
              intelligence, and visually rich content publishing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Clinical Intelligence</h4>
            <p>
              Pages focused on OPD workflows, medical notes, case sheets, treatment logic, and practical healthcare
              automation.
            </p>
            <div class="pill-row">
              <span class="pill">OPD AI</span>
              <span class="pill">Case Sheets</span>
              <span class="pill">Treatment Logic</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>AI Systems</h4>
            <p>
              A structured area for AI hub content, lab experiments, automation projects, and model-driven workflows.
            </p>
            <div class="pill-row">
              <span class="pill">AI Hub</span>
              <span class="pill">AI Lab</span>
              <span class="pill">Projects</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Research & Knowledge Base</h4>
            <p>
              Research notes, surveys, analysis, healthcare economics, visual explainers, and content that needs a
              disciplined publishing system.
            </p>
            <div class="pill-row">
              <span class="pill">Researches</span>
              <span class="pill">Data Analysis</span>
              <span class="pill">Visual Library</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="architecture">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Architecture</h3>
            <p>
              The stack is deliberately conservative: Astro for static delivery, MDX for content-heavy pages,
              component wrappers for repeatable UI, and defensive shells for complex HTML.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Source layer</h4>
            <p>Markdown, MDX, Astro components, layouts, styles, and content folders live in the repository.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Build layer</h4>
            <p>`npm run build` generates static routes and the final site output in `dist/`.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Deployment layer</h4>
            <p>The generated output is suitable for GitHub Pages or any static hosting target.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="codebox" aria-label="Architecture code snippet">
          <header>
            <strong>Content flow</strong>
            <span>deterministic and reversible</span>
          </header>
          <pre>AI-generated HTML
   ↓
input/
   ↓
ingest_html.py
   ↓
src/pages/[category]/[slug].astro
   ↓
RichContentShell.astro
   ↓
npm run build
   ↓
dist/
   ↓
GitHub / hosting</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="structure">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Recommended repository structure</h3>
            <p>
              A clear folder model reduces confusion for contributors and makes it obvious what is source, what is
              generated output, and what is local-only.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>GitHub / source</h4>
            <p>
              <code>src/</code>, <code>public/</code>, configs, workflows, documentation, and content that should be
              version-controlled.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Local only</h4>
            <p>
              <code>node_modules/</code>, <code>.astro/</code>, <code>dist/</code>, editor state, and any machine-only
              artifacts.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Junk</h4>
            <p>
              Logs, swap files, temporary files, OS clutter, and dead backups that should be ignored or deleted.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="workflow">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Publishing workflow</h3>
            <p>
              The workflow is built for controlled growth. Each page type has a preferred path, which prevents
              accidental design drift.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="index">1</div>
            <strong>Draft</strong>
            <p>Write in Markdown, MDX, or raw HTML depending on content complexity.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="index">2</div>
            <strong>Ingest</strong>
            <p>Use the HTML ingestion script for AI-generated or messy external content.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="index">3</div>
            <strong>Validate</strong>
            <p>Run build checks and confirm links, imports, responsive layout, and route output.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="index">4</div>
            <strong>Publish</strong>
            <p>Commit, push, and deploy only after the repository is clean and the build is stable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="deploy">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Deployment notes</h3>
            <p>
              This repo is designed for GitHub-first operations: source in the repository, output generated locally,
              and live pages served from static hosting.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Install</h4>
            <p><code>npm install</code> to restore dependencies from <code>package.json</code>.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Build</h4>
            <p><code>npm run build</code> to generate the final static site in <code>dist/</code>.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="section-card">
            <h4>Deploy</h4>
            <p>Push source to GitHub and serve the generated output through your chosen static host.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .showcase-content {
    --bg: #08111f;
    --bg2: #0d1730;
    --card: rgba(14, 22, 40, 0.82);
    --card2: rgba(16, 29, 54, 0.92);
    --line: rgba(140, 170, 255, 0.18);
    --line2: rgba(98, 150, 255, 0.3);
    --text: #e7edf8;
    --muted: #a5b4c7;
    --accent: #7dd3fc;
    --accent2: #a78bfa;
    --good: #86efac;
    --warn: #fbbf24;
    --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    --radius: 24px;
    --max: 1180px;
    --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
    --sans: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;

    font-family: var(--sans);
    color: var(--text);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.14), transparent 30%),
      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.15), transparent 34%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #050914 100%);
    min-height: 100vh;
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 32px 0;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hero-panel,
  .side-panel,
  .section-card,
  .metric,
  .codebox {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card), rgba(10, 16, 30, 0.76));
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .hero-panel {
    padding: 34px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-panel::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto -90px -90px auto;
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.18), transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.22);
    background: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.08);
    color: #dbeafe;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .showcase-content h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .showcase-content h2 span {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: 0.18s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .btn.primary {
    color: #07111f;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.18);
  }

  .btn.secondary {
    color: var(--text);
    border-color: var(--line2);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }

  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

  .metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .metric {
    padding: 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 29, 54, 0.92), rgba(12, 18, 33, 0.9));
  }

  .metric .num {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .metric .label {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .side-panel {
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .showcase-content h3,
  .section-head h3 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .mini-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .mini-list li {
    padding: 14px 14px 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .mini-list strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  section { padding: 20px 0 0; }

  .section-head {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: end;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .section-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .section-card {
    padding: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 29, 54, 0.9), rgba(10, 16, 30, 0.88));
  }

  .section-card h4 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .section-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .pill-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .pill {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    color: #cbd5e1;
    padding: 8px 11px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .codebox {
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .codebox header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }

  .codebox header span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 16px 20px;
    overflow: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #dbeafe;
  }

  .timeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .step {
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }

  .step .index {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    color: #07111f;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .step strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text); }
  .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .grid-3,
    .timeline {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { padding-top: 42px; }
    .hero-panel, .side-panel, .section-card { padding: 20px; }
    .metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-row { flex-direction: column; }
    .btn { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
